                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4dccaa4-0535-343e-ad73-852892b7fd73",
                                        "entry_id": "fbc705e5-11c8-3d8f-9362-37806eebed08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The property of a logical theory that whenever a wff is valid then it must also be a theorem. Symbolically, letting T represent a theory within logic L, this can be represented as the property that whenever T⊨ϕ is true, then T⊢ϕ must also be true, for any wff φ of logic L."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35b14715-8598-45f2-a6f8-5c5958d3fad6",
                                                "sense_id": "b4dccaa4-0535-343e-ad73-852892b7fd73",
                                                "text": "THEOREM 37°. (Gödel's completeness theorem 1930.) In the predicate calculus H:\n(a) If #92;vDashF [or even if #92;aleph#95;0-#92;vDashF], then #92;vdashF. If E#95;1,...,E#95;k#92;vDashF [or even if E#95;1,...,E#95;k#92;#92;aleph#95;0-#92;vDashF], then E#95;1,...,E#95;k#92;vdashF.\n(b) […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "390fd54a-b068-4b90-b3b8-a1a9177d9bbb",
                        "source_entry_id": "218220eb-ff28-3ba3-8e72-d0335bc8a8f7",
                        "target_lang_word": "coverage",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "coverage",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4cebdec-1701-36ce-950f-7d749349b2a9",
                                        "entry_id": "7f6a50da-e7da-3146-aef4-45d7df3b9a05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An amount by which something or someone is covered."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00196070-10a3-4a80-90d5-103f83eec92a",
                                                "sense_id": "c4cebdec-1701-36ce-950f-7d749349b2a9",
                                                "text": "Don't go to lunch if we don't have enough coverage for the help-desk phones."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9fef75c-0211-4ac2-bb9b-86b7b0ba2e51",
                                                "sense_id": "c4cebdec-1701-36ce-950f-7d749349b2a9",
                                                "text": "Before laying sod on that clay, the ground needs two inches of coverage with topsoil."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8713ca63-3cb0-4a70-a57c-dab468372466",
                                                "sense_id": "c4cebdec-1701-36ce-950f-7d749349b2a9",
                                                "text": "The enemy fire is increasing – can we get some immediate coverage from those bunkers?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c733283a-0915-41fd-9a1b-b3a634bf15d5",
                                                "sense_id": "c4cebdec-1701-36ce-950f-7d749349b2a9",
                                                "text": "There are overlapping coverages on your insurance policies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0efe48b9-b884-45db-9d36-f28b7e051432",
                                                "sense_id": "c4cebdec-1701-36ce-950f-7d749349b2a9",
                                                "text": "Professionally published dictionaries do not seem to have extended coverage beyond the most frequent and salient items."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a073c1c5-bcc3-3c9e-9d16-2136defdcf3e",
                                        "entry_id": "7f6a50da-e7da-3146-aef4-45d7df3b9a05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The amount and type of attention given to an event or topic in news media or other media."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff30da7a-7bbb-4b6d-8f22-b0e511da1ed9",
                                                "sense_id": "a073c1c5-bcc3-3c9e-9d16-2136defdcf3e",
                                                "text": "Through services using the Elizabeth line were increased from November 6, but this did not attract significant media coverage - mainly because it has been an operational success, […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff9ba5ab-5ef4-30b2-8ef5-c556fb6249d7",
                                        "entry_id": "7f6a50da-e7da-3146-aef4-45d7df3b9a05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The average number of reads representing a given nucleotide in the reconstructed sequence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
